   "post_data": {
    "post_id": 2024477,
    "post_type": "forum",
    "topic_id": 367750,
    "poster_id": 67223,
    "post_rendered": "Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/2/fa2fa899f0afb05d6837885523503a2d4df434f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$E$\"  width=\"14\" height=\"12\" > be a finite set of points such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/2/fa2fa899f0afb05d6837885523503a2d4df434f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$E$\"  width=\"14\" height=\"12\" > is not contained in a plane and no three points of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/2/fa2fa899f0afb05d6837885523503a2d4df434f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$E$\"  width=\"14\" height=\"12\" > are collinear. Show that at least one of the following alternatives holds:<br>\n<br>\n(i) <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/2/fa2fa899f0afb05d6837885523503a2d4df434f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$E$\"  width=\"14\" height=\"12\" > contains five points that are vertices of a convex pyramid having no other points in common with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/0/4107bba47d9e5644446098e35672a36d9c1560c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$E;$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"18\" height=\"16\" ><br>\n<br>\n(ii) some plane contains exactly three points from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/0/710fb5fa3adedd7a16739e543d846747adbe05b5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$E.$\"  width=\"18\" height=\"12\" >",
    "post_canonical": "Let $E$ be a finite set of points such that $E$ is not contained in a plane and no three points of $E$ are collinear. Show that at least one of the following alternatives holds:\n\n(i) $E$ contains five points that are vertices of a convex pyramid having no other points in common with $E;$\n\n(ii) some plane contains exactly three points from $E.$",
    "username": "Amir Hossein",
    "post_number": 1,
    "post_format": "bbcode",
    "category_name": "High School Olympiads",
    "category_id": 6,
    "poster_avatar": "//avatar.artofproblemsolving.com/avatar_67223.png?t=1769913889"
   }
